{"source":"github","project_id":"hugo-graphite","target":"rstudio/hugo-graphite","id":"pr/43","ref":43,"title":"Desiree css","description":"Ports in design changes from [tidymodels.org](https://www.tidymodels.org/)\r\n\r\n**New \u0026 improved features:**\r\n\r\n * gains sticky TOC for blog posts\r\n\r\n * gains copy-to-clipboard for code chunks\r\n\r\n* gains anchorized header links\r\n\r\n * gains new shortcodes\r\n\r\n * gains 2 new layout types\r\n\r\n*  better image accessibility\r\n\r\n*  larger base font sizes for improved accessibility\r\n\r\n * more parameters for site customization of colors and fonts\r\n\r\n**Small tweaks**\r\n\r\n * hexes on package pages are now symmetric not squished\r\n\r\n*  improved functioning for highlighting active menu items in the upper navbar (even with Hugo nested sections)\r\n\r\n*  jQuery upgrade\r\n\r\n* improved RSS feed handling\r\n\r\n*  styled footnotes from goldmark renderer work again\r\n\r\n*  Includes chroma CSS styles for highlighting via downlit for hugodown sites\r\n\r\n * shiny new demo site courtesy of @dcossyleon\r\n\r\n*  new Hugo theme ","published_at":"2020-06-03T18:58:36Z","updated_at":"2020-07-01T04:29:48Z","url":"https://github.com/rstudio/hugo-graphite/pull/43","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"dcossyleon","merged_at":"2020-07-01T04:29:48Z","state":"MERGED"}}
{"source":"github","project_id":"hugo-graphite","target":"rstudio/hugo-graphite","id":"pr/33","ref":33,"title":"JQuery update + Hex shape fix","description":"* Updates JQuery\r\n* Regularizes the empty hex shapes on the packages page","published_at":"2020-05-08T18:13:24Z","updated_at":"2020-05-08T21:34:21Z","url":"https://github.com/rstudio/hugo-graphite/pull/33","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"dcossyleon","merged_at":"2020-05-08T21:34:21Z","state":"MERGED"}}
{"source":"github","project_id":"hugo-graphite","target":"rstudio/hugo-graphite","id":"pr/30","ref":30,"title":"Better image accessibility","description":"Hi @batpigandme,\r\n\r\nMaking some changes to how images are rendered in the CSS/Hugo layout files.\r\n\r\n+ Adding option for alt text for wide banner image that appears on single pages in the `blog` section, which is also no longer a background image. If blank, `alt =\"\"`.\r\n\r\n+ Adding thumbnail images on `blog` list layout as regular images inside a div, rather than background images, with `alt=\"\"`.\r\n\r\nAddresses: https://github.com/rstudio/hugo-tourmaline/issues/29, https://github.com/tidyverse/tidyverse.org/issues/205, https://github.com/tidyverse/tidyverse.org/issues/374, https://github.com/tidyverse/tidyverse.org/pull/411","published_at":"2020-04-29T03:29:00Z","updated_at":"2020-05-26T15:33:32Z","url":"https://github.com/rstudio/hugo-graphite/pull/30","tags":["accessibility :curly_loop:"],"type":"pr","extra":{"author":"apreshill","merged_at":"2020-05-26T15:33:32Z","state":"MERGED"}}
